        <mxCell id="65" value="The final structure remains seven tables. Normalization does not require a new table when no violating dependency is established.&lt;br&gt;License_no is treated as an independent PK in CREW_MEMBER, as in the supplied mapping. If its double border means a weak entity, the owner key and partial key must first be clarified.&lt;br&gt;FLIGHTCREW.FlightNumber is retained as drawn. Its name alone does not establish an FK; no extra relationship is invented.&lt;br&gt;The 3NF result is conditional on the dependencies listed above. Additional business rules may require a different decomposition." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=24;fontColor=#204D7B;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
